<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 Lower. Demand and movement were light to moderate. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50 Few 56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  50.00-54.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  45.50-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 41.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-44.50</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 44.00-47.00 Few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>47.50-48.50</p>
</text>
